WEBVTT

00:11:28.451 --> 00:11:32.421
But -- and I hope you
are expecting a "but" by now --

00:11:32.445 --> 00:11:34.852
but that wasn't true for everyone.

00:11:34.876 --> 00:11:38.514
People who spent time caring for others

00:11:38.538 --> 00:11:43.041
showed absolutely no stress-related
increase in dying.

00:11:43.065 --> 00:11:44.065
Zero.

00:11:44.738 --> 00:11:46.813
Caring created resilience.

00:11:48.233 --> 00:11:49.692
And so we see once again

00:11:49.716 --> 00:11:52.330
that the harmful effects
of stress on your health

00:11:52.354 --> 00:11:53.994
are not inevitable.

00:11:54.578 --> 00:11:57.014
How you think and how you act

00:11:57.038 --> 00:12:00.078
can transform your experience of stress.